sec.p:
Load cells that are equipped with functions typically performed by complete instruments may be required to be evaluated against additional requirements contained in other OIML Recommendations for those complete instruments. These additional evaluations are outside the scope of this Recommendation (see  2.3
 and Figure 2
).

5⁢°C for load cells of class A;
15⁢°C for load cells of class B;
30⁢°C for load cells of classes C and D.

list-item.p:
for a weighing instrument (for example a multiple range instrument according to
OIML R 76 [1]), the relative vmin, Y, where
Y=(Emax−Emin)/vmin (see 3.5.15);

for a weighing instrument (for example a multi-interval instrument according to
OIML R 76) [1], the relative DR, Z, where
Z=(Emax−Emin)/(2×DR) (see 3.5.14) and the value of DR (see  3.5.10) is set at the maximum permissible minimum dead load output return according to R 60-2, 2.10.1;
